{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Hunt Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ensnared in a brutal, tournament style gauntlet. Where players pilot heavily armed ships, galleons, and frigates, clashing in demolition derby style battles across the Caribbean. Only the last ship standing will claim the prize: freedom from the malevolent force that binds them to this deadly game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Unsettled Seas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tournaments are hosted by the Vodou spirits, known as Loa, and every entry will bring both diseases and curses beasts. some bless you, others will kill you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/00dd965c4c86a77a9a97e127c627b539.poster.avif?t=1757513275\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/00dd965c4c86a77a9a97e127c627b539.webm?t=1757513275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/00dd965c4c86a77a9a97e127c627b539.mp4?t=1757513275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coordinate Brutal Naval Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Gloom&quot; is the prize for winning these tournaments, making participation a desperate fight for survival against both other players and the inexorable march of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/a154061bb2706fe1b2ca31795bd9d0ef.poster.avif?t=1757513275\" width=596 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/a154061bb2706fe1b2ca31795bd9d0ef.webm?t=1757513275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/extras/a154061bb2706fe1b2ca31795bd9d0ef.mp4?t=1757513275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your fleet in real-time battles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supply &amp; demand trade system, affected by piracy, random events, &amp; conflicts. When items are abundant, the prices go down and vice versa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world continues to evolve with or without your intervention. Factions will still attack each other, ports will run out of supplies, pirates will go on raids, etc.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1911760?t=1757513275","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1911760?t=1757513275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757513275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757513275","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Hunt Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is ensnared in a brutal, tournament style gauntlet. Where players pilot heavily armed ships, galleons, and frigates, clashing in demolition derby style battles across the Caribbean. Only the last ship standing will claim the prize: freedom from the malevolent force that binds them to this deadly game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Unsettled Seas</h2><p clas