paragraph\" >Supply &amp; demand trade system, affected by piracy, random events, &amp; conflicts. When items are abundant, the prices go down and vice versa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world continues to evolve with or without your intervention. Factions will still attack each other, ports will run out of supplies, pirates will go on raids, etc.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Oni Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/header.jpg?t=1757513275","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Testt","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"SeaDogs Of Nassau","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 7, 64-bit Windows 8 (8.1) or 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel CPU Core i5-2500K 3.3GHz / AMD CPU Phenom II X4 940<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GPU GeForce GTX 660 / AMD GPU Radeon HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 35 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Oni Entertainment"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"true"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q3 2027"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/ss_f53fa1d14f7530fa2e2f544576270c17d04fbe70.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757513275","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911760/ss_f53fa1d14f7530fa2e2f544576270c17d04fbe70.600x338.jpg?t=1757513275"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/